OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALost pages of book saved by Henry
OL,4,AVIII aide found
OL,5,
OL,6,FAcademics from the universities of
OL,7,FSussex and Cambridge have discovered
OL,8,Fsix missing pages of a medieval
OL,9,FCatholic manuscript in a Brighton
OL,10,Farchive.
OL,12,FSir John Gage was a Tudor courtier
OL,13,Ftasked by Henry VIII with overseeing
OL,14,Fthe dissolution of monasteries across
OL,15,FSussex, Surrey and Kent from 1536.
OL,17,FNew research suggests Sir John, who
OL,18,Fremained a Catholic throughout the
OL,19,FReformation, shielded a manuscript of
OL,20,FNicholas Love's Mirror Of The Blessed
OL,21,FLife Of Jesus Christ.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
