OL,3,GNEWSALost pages of book saved by Henry
OL,4,AVIII aide found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pages were found at The Keep
OL,7,Farchive, having been missing from the
OL,8,Fcontents list of a box deposited with
OL,9,Fthe Sussex Archaeological Society in
OL,10,F1929, and have now been matched with
OL,11,Fthe rest of the manuscript held at Yale
OL,12,FUniversity.
